  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - United States-Southeast Asia Aviation Cooperation Program Reverse Trade Mission Series, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Reverse Trade Mission (RTM) series will support two separate and distinct RTMs to the United States in support of the U.S.- Southeast Asia Aviation Cooperation Program (ACP). The RTMs will bring up to 30 public and private aviation sector representatives from Southeast Asia and potentially Pacific Island countries to the United States to familiarize delegates with U.S. aviation best practices, equipment, and technology, and will discuss topics such as aviation safety during the COVID-19 pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
